A thin strip of fabric worn around the neck with the ends overlapping in front. Also known as a continental tie.

A type of formal neckwear. May be part of a [[suit]], a uniform or other [[formal clothes]].

Not to be confused with [[bolo tie]] (aka spaghetti tie).

